  "limitations": [
    "Two final-layer NexusCRM parent sources, contract and quote, are counted separately. Rows, exact whole-record versions and source-local Id groups are different units; none is a unique customer, executed contract, current service or incident count.",
    "Every row and occurrence remains in the private census. Whole-record versions include excluded amounts, terms, payload and ingestion changes. Multiple versions under one Id are quarantined from target admission; no latest row or business primary-key contract is elected. Single-version groups are not admitted targets either.",
    "Id and AccountId are private source-and-role-qualified candidate groups; quote additionally includes OpportunityId. Only nonempty strings of at most 256 Unicode characters without padding, whitespace or Unicode control/format characters pass the declared syntax. Other types are not coerced. This grammar is not an authoritative native-ID contract.",
    "Source-local role counts are exploratory cardinality diagnostics. Existing account/opportunity projections lack compatible exact whole-record versions and were not loaded or joined. Equal source-local group counts or literal strings do not establish shared identities, native references, company relationships or cross-CRM equivalence.",
    "Status and contract StatusCode use fixed syntax/type categories only. IsDeleted and contract Archived__c use literal/type categories. No raw enum vocabulary is published or interpreted as approval, execution, lifecycle, enforceability or customer activity.",
    "Named dates and timestamps use fixed calendar/syntax categories only. No raw times, ordering, service durations, effective dates, latest-state election, current state, snapshot completeness or historical ownership is inferred.",
    "All declared fields and late unknown fields were counted over all rows, including absence. Additional field names and their private hashes are omitted; only their source-local count is published. First-row inventory schemas were not treated as all-row contracts.",
    "Amounts, prices, fees, credits, currency, terms, quantities/counts, names, configuration, descriptions, quote/contract numbers, owner/person IDs, source metadata and Pricebook2Id/RecordTypeId remain presence/type only. No raw values, identifiers, per-record hashes, amounts, totals, URLs or credentials are exported.",
    "Exact typed whole-record hashing preserves numeric precision, scalar types and signed zero. Raw-line differences remain separate diagnostics. No source union, native/polymorphic join, accepted reference target, financial interpretation, company/customer/Hong Kong attribution or incident-impact claim is made.",
    "Only the two parent streams belong to this census. Line-item/product sources, raw layers, Salesforce sources and document bodies are outside it. A later phase requires its own reviewed scope and reference policy.",
    "This export recomputes the retained private assessment read-only. Original stream parsing and byte/EOF truth rely on frozen scan receipts and unchanged archive identity; the exporter does not reread archive contents."
  ],
